# Freshness audit of 2026-10-04 (rex-main, 7 auditors and 7 skeptics over the feature/rex-v02 tree at 3cda703): every entry is a statement in a README, manifest, doc, template or community file that no longer matches the code or the spec decisions, with the evidence and the replacement. Tasks 8.4 to 8.7 close them by file; the task field names the owner.

[stale.1]
