actual = "By default rex new runs with --ui designx: it fetches the DesignX registry over the network (fetchDesignx, packages/rex/src/cli/commands/new.ts:359-360; registry https://dxuireact.com/r) and then runs `<package manager> install` itself unless --no-install is passed (new.ts:366 installPackages; packages/rex/src/cli/designx.ts:479-486 picks pnpm/yarn/bun/npm from npm_config_user_agent). The separate `pnpm install` step is only needed after --ui none or --no-install, and neither flag (new.ts:382-383) is mentioned."
fix = "rex new my-app                  # write a complete app into ./my-app; by default (--ui designx) it fetches the DesignX set from https://dxuireact.com/r and runs the package manager install itself (--no-install skips the install; --ui none writes a plain Button and runs no install)\ncd my-app\npnpm install                    # only after --ui none or --no-install; the generated package.json depends on @sidioralabs/rex ^0.1.0"

