actual = "The generated node entry (build.ts:140-191) reads the config export with readConfigExport/configServer (so a defineConfig or a deprecated bare app), imports `dist/manifest.json`, calls installNodeStaticPages for the prerendered pages and starts with startPrerenderedNodeServer (server/node.ts:95-104 over startNodeServer). In createNodeApp (server/adapters/node.ts:56-72) a GET/HEAD page-route path (last segment without a dot) is first passed to the app; a response carrying the render-kind header (server-rendered or prerendered page) is returned as is, otherwise the static asset is tried and then index.html is served with Client Hints headers (withClientHints, :69). PORT default 3000 (build.ts:57, 167), HOST and `rex: serving <url>` (build.ts:60) are current."
