[stale.49]
task = "8.5"
slice = "cli-reference"
file = "docs/cli.md"
line = 0
severity = "missing"
stale = "## rex migrate (section absent)"
actual = "packages/rex/src/cli/commands/migrate.ts:153-173 registers `rex migrate [--from <version>] [--list]`; `--from` defaults to \"0.1\" (DEFAULT_FROM :14); `--list` prints `<id>  <description>` per codemod (formatCodemodList :131-136); otherwise every codemod registered for that version in cli/codemods/ (loadCodemods :71-85, file pattern `<major.minor>-<name>.ts` codemods/codemod.ts:5) runs, changed files are written and the report prints `<id>: <n> changed` or `no changes`, `  changed <file>` lines, one `REX610 <file>:<line>:<column> <message> (<docs url>)` line per flag (formatFlag codemod.ts:51-53) and `migrated from <version>: <n> files changed, <m> flagged for the author` (formatMigrateReport :138-151). An unknown version exits 2 with `rex migrate: no codemods migrate from \"<v>\"; known versions: ...` (MigrateError :38-46, :91-99, :166-169). Registered codemods: 0.1-config (codemods/0.1-config.ts:102-104), 0.1-page-render (0.1-page-render.ts:231-234), 0.1-raw-img (0.1-raw-img.ts:180-183), 0.1-schema-entry (0.1-schema-entry.ts:294-296). Required by the spec decision `versioning` (spec/rex-v02/spec.kvx:34)."
fix = "## rex migrate\n\n```\nrex migrate [--from <version>] [--list]\n```\n\n| Option | Default | Effect |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `--from <version>` | `0.1` | the Rex version the app was written for; an unknown version exits 2 with `rex migrate: no codemods migrate from \"<version>\"; known versions: ...` |\n| `--list` | | print `<id>  <description>` for the codemods of that version without applying them |\n\nRuns every codemod registered for the version (`packages/rex/src/cli/codemods/<version>-<name>.ts`, built on the TypeScript compiler API) against the app in the current directory, writes the changed files and prints, per codemod, `<id>: <n> changed` (or `no changes`) with one `changed <file>` line per file, one `REX610 <file>:<line>:<column> <message> (<docs link>)` line per placeholder left for the author, and `migrated from <version>: <n> files changed, <m> flagged for the author`.\n\n| Codemod | Change |\n| --- | --- |\n| `0.1-config` | wrap a bare Hono app default export of `rex.config.ts` in `defineConfig({ app, server })` |\n| `0.1-page-render` | keep client rendering with `render: \"csr\"` on pages that read browser globals while rendering; every other page takes the 0.2 default |\n| `0.1-raw-img` | convert `img` elements in regions and parts to `Img`, flagging width, height and alt placeholders as REX610 |\n| `0.1-schema-entry` | move `z` to `zod/mini` and the field helpers, config and manifest names from `@sidioralabs/rex` to `@sidioralabs/rex/schema`, `@sidioralabs/rex/config` and `@sidioralabs/rex/manifest`, and the interop, media and i18n names from `@sidioralabs/rex/client` to `@sidioralabs/rex/client/interop`, `/client/media` and `/client/i18n` |"

