fix = "Add to packages/rex/package.json: \"repository\": { \"type\": \"git\", \"url\": \"git+https://github.com/Sidiora-Labs/rex-js.git\", \"directory\": \"packages/rex\" } (plus \"homepage\" and \"bugs\" if wanted) and assert it in src/cli/pack.test.ts."

